    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tankiro is an action-packed parry combat game inspired by the Souls-like genre. Play as a lone tank defending Earth from an alien invasion, using only your tank barrel to attack and your armor to parry and block enemy strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle various alien bosses on Earth's surface, then take the fight to their mothership in space. Defeat them and save the planet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628730/extras/adc14f9e54d56edbfd7f3189bcf834b6.poster.avif?t=1754860303\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628730/extras/adc14f9e54d56edbfd7f3189bcf834b6.webm?t=1754860303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628730/extras/adc14f9e54d56edbfd7f3189bcf834b6.mp4?t=1754860303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry-Based Combat System</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Bosses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Souls-Like Inspired Gameplay</strong></p></li></ul>",
